1
00:00:25,330 --> 00:00:28,125
♪Break the chain, erase the curl♪

2
00:00:28,423 --> 00:00:31,090
♪I rise up with my inner pearl♪

3
00:00:31,283 --> 00:00:34,192
♪Self-rescue fire burning full♪

4
00:00:34,572 --> 00:00:37,620
♪I'm the master of my rule♪

5
00:00:37,898 --> 00:00:40,046
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

6
00:00:40,245 --> 00:00:43,030
♪Calm but full of pearl♪

7
00:00:44,010 --> 00:00:46,011
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

8
00:00:46,217 --> 00:00:49,257
♪I rule my whole own whirl♪

9
00:01:30,680 --> 00:01:31,480
Lu Mingyu.

10
00:01:31,680 --> 00:01:32,680
Why so slow?

11
00:01:32,799 --> 00:01:33,760
You've been at this forever.

12
00:01:33,879 --> 00:01:34,840
I'm warning you.

13
00:01:35,040 --> 00:01:35,640
If you make us late

14
00:01:35,640 --> 00:01:37,359
for Qin Yuan's birthday party tonight,

15
00:01:37,760 --> 00:01:38,840
I'll make you pay.

16
00:01:44,480 --> 00:01:45,640
Almost done.

17
00:01:45,799 --> 00:01:47,319
Just a few details left.

18
00:01:47,840 --> 00:01:49,840
After freeloading off us
all these years,

19
00:01:50,359 --> 00:01:51,760
you're finally good for something.

20
00:02:02,031 --> 00:02:03,273
=Quite The Girl=

21
00:02:03,273 --> 00:02:04,350
(Adapted from the Tomato Novel
"Quite the Girl.")

22
00:02:04,350 --> 00:02:05,225
(Author: Wo Shafei Kuxin)

23
00:02:05,225 --> 00:02:06,484
=Episode 1=

24
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:15,719
How's the task my mom gave us?

25
00:02:16,080 --> 00:02:17,800
Mrs. Duan's information is outdated.

26
00:02:18,159 --> 00:02:19,080
It's hard to track her down.

27
00:02:19,400 --> 00:02:21,080
I want results, not excuses.

28
00:02:21,840 --> 00:02:23,280
Got it. I'll get right on it.

29
00:02:23,639 --> 00:02:25,599
Auntie Chen was my mom's best friend
when they were young.

30
00:02:25,879 --> 00:02:27,199
If you still can't find her,

31
00:02:27,479 --> 00:02:29,120
I'll feed you to the sharks.

32
00:02:29,719 --> 00:02:30,360
Understood.

33
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:31,919
I'll get a team on it right away.

34
00:02:33,039 --> 00:02:33,719
One more thing, Xiuming.

35
00:02:34,039 --> 00:02:35,479
A distant relative's throwing
a birthday party.

36
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:36,560
Want to show your face?

37
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:38,159
It could help you make connections
in Xizi City.

38
00:02:38,159 --> 00:02:38,680
(Guest Rooms)

39
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:39,479
No.

40
00:02:39,599 --> 00:02:40,719
These kinds of events

41
00:02:41,039 --> 00:02:42,280
are a complete waste of time.

42
00:03:17,159 --> 00:03:17,960
Lu Mingyu!

43
00:03:19,159 --> 00:03:20,280
Where the heck have you been?

44
00:03:20,479 --> 00:03:21,759
Qin Yuan's birthday party
is about to start.

45
00:03:21,759 --> 00:03:22,599
What took you so long?

46
00:03:22,599 --> 00:03:23,719
Sorry, Qian.

47
00:03:23,919 --> 00:03:25,080
I haven't been out in so long.

48
00:03:25,199 --> 00:03:26,199
So I went to the wrong hotel.

49
00:03:26,919 --> 00:03:27,479
Where's the painting?

50
00:03:28,400 --> 00:03:29,520
I left it in the lounge.

51
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:32,120
(Their parents passed away early.)

52
00:03:32,120 --> 00:03:34,039
(As long as Qian Yuan agrees,)

53
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:35,840
(my marriage to Qin Lian)

54
00:03:35,840 --> 00:03:37,360
(is a done deal.)

55
00:03:37,960 --> 00:03:38,759
Be smart.

56
00:03:38,879 --> 00:03:39,439
Come with me.

57
00:03:45,360 --> 00:03:46,000
I'm so sorry.

58
00:03:46,159 --> 00:03:47,479
I'll get someone to clean it up.

59
00:03:47,919 --> 00:03:49,080
I'm really sorry.

60
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:51,080
Look at you!

61
00:03:51,240 --> 00:03:52,439
So clumsy.

62
00:03:52,759 --> 00:03:53,520
What a jinx.

63
00:03:54,199 --> 00:03:55,680
This outfit is the latest style.

64
00:03:56,479 --> 00:03:57,319
I'm sorry.

65
00:03:57,560 --> 00:03:58,800
What are you waiting for?

66
00:03:58,879 --> 00:04:00,319
Can't you see the floor's wet?

67
00:04:00,599 --> 00:04:01,840
You expect me to step in it?

68
00:04:02,199 --> 00:04:03,680
Hold up my dress.

69
00:04:09,280 --> 00:04:10,159
Watch it.

70
00:04:12,840 --> 00:04:14,479
Such a pretty face,

71
00:04:15,039 --> 00:04:16,240
yet no personality at all.

72
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:17,920
Boring.

73
00:04:19,040 --> 00:04:19,959
(Very nice.)

74
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:23,800
Qin Yuan,

75
00:04:23,839 --> 00:04:24,399
I specially prepared

76
00:04:24,399 --> 00:04:25,839
this birthday gift for you.

77
00:04:26,720 --> 00:04:28,079
How thoughtful of you, Qian.

78
00:04:28,360 --> 00:04:30,000
I love this painting.

79
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:53,160
Get this wretched thing

80
00:04:53,160 --> 00:04:54,040
out of my sight!

81
00:04:54,040 --> 00:04:54,720
Qin Yuan,

82
00:04:54,839 --> 00:04:55,920
I don't know what happened.

83
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:56,560
Hurry up!

84
00:04:56,959 --> 00:04:57,720
I'm sorry!

85
00:04:57,879 --> 00:04:58,800
I'll throw it out right now!

86
00:04:59,120 --> 00:04:59,879
Qin Yuan, I...

87
00:05:00,120 --> 00:05:01,439
Qin Yuan, I'm sorry...

88
00:05:05,346 --> 00:05:08,760
♪I'm a good girl but not naive♪

89
00:05:09,166 --> 00:05:11,652
♪Power hidden underneath♪

90
00:05:11,780 --> 00:05:14,454
♪Fight my way, rise from the grief♪

91
00:05:14,620 --> 00:05:17,822
♪Rule my world, set myself free♪

92
00:05:18,102 --> 00:05:20,601
♪No more bondage, no more deceit♪

93
00:05:20,674 --> 00:05:24,120
♪My own salvation I believe♪

94
00:05:24,275 --> 00:05:27,040
♪Burn the haze, break every siege♪

95
00:05:27,081 --> 00:05:30,023
♪I'm the queen of my own destiny♪

96
00:05:30,720 --> 00:05:33,155
♪No more bondage, no more deceit♪

97
00:05:33,301 --> 00:05:36,715
♪My own salvation I believe♪

98
00:05:36,846 --> 00:05:39,366
♪Burn the haze, break every siege♪

99
00:05:39,544 --> 00:05:42,530
♪I'm the queen of my own destiny♪

100
00:05:48,639 --> 00:05:49,480
Well done.

101
00:05:57,160 --> 00:06:00,000
(Patient in public,
ruthless in private.)

102
00:06:00,360 --> 00:06:02,079
(This girl's interesting.)

103
00:06:02,079 --> 00:06:04,215
♪I'll write my own story♪

104
00:06:04,639 --> 00:06:06,319
(Great shape.)

105
00:06:06,319 --> 00:06:09,440
♪I'll just start again
if all else fails♪

106
00:06:09,723 --> 00:06:11,600
♪I don't need your glory♪

107
00:06:12,509 --> 00:06:16,160
♪Touch the sky with my head held high♪

108
00:06:16,383 --> 00:06:18,930
♪I'll say what I have to say♪

109
00:06:20,058 --> 00:06:23,840
♪In my mind it's a fierce desire♪

110
00:06:23,979 --> 00:06:27,726
♪You better get out of my way♪

111
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:32,519
Single?

112
00:06:33,120 --> 00:06:33,920
Yes.

113
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:36,279
Want to sleep together?

114
00:06:38,519 --> 00:06:39,319
What?

115
00:06:40,120 --> 00:06:40,920
No?

116
00:06:41,639 --> 00:06:42,360
Suit yourself.

117
00:06:43,001 --> 00:06:46,075
♪I'm winning every day♪

118
00:06:46,830 --> 00:06:49,870
♪I'm looking for no approval♪

119
00:06:50,122 --> 00:06:53,462
♪Because I'm doing things in my own way♪

120
00:06:57,917 --> 00:07:00,317
♪I'm doing things in my own way♪

121
00:07:01,240 --> 00:07:02,000
All right.

122
00:07:02,639 --> 00:07:03,439
Let's do it.

123
00:07:04,375 --> 00:07:07,880
♪Because I'm doing things in my own way♪

124
00:07:08,440 --> 00:07:11,067
♪Baby, you deserve it♪

125
00:07:12,584 --> 00:07:16,930
♪You're the perfect one I seek♪

126
00:07:17,017 --> 00:07:20,910
♪Stare at me, tell me you need me♪

127
00:07:21,178 --> 00:07:23,372
♪Baby, you deserve it♪

128
00:07:25,461 --> 00:07:27,808
♪Baby, you deserve it♪

129
00:07:29,800 --> 00:07:32,000
Why this old-fashioned clip, young lady?

130
00:07:32,240 --> 00:07:33,519
You have a good figure.

131
00:07:33,720 --> 00:07:35,240
Why are your movements so gentle?

132
00:07:35,250 --> 00:07:37,543
♪All my world's meant for you to keep♪

133
00:07:37,959 --> 00:07:39,360
Don't beg me to stop later.

134
00:07:39,360 --> 00:07:41,439
♪Keep every piece,
every breath for you deep♪

135
00:07:59,484 --> 00:08:01,998
♪Baby, you deserve it♪

136
00:08:03,510 --> 00:08:07,856
♪You're the perfect one I seek♪

137
00:08:07,936 --> 00:08:11,829
♪Stare at me, tell me you need me♪

138
00:08:11,965 --> 00:08:14,159
♪Baby, you deserve it♪

139
00:08:16,332 --> 00:08:20,678
♪You're the perfect one I seek♪

140
00:08:20,744 --> 00:08:24,637
♪Stare at me, tell me you need me♪

141
00:08:24,799 --> 00:08:26,993
♪Baby, you deserve it♪

142
00:08:29,271 --> 00:08:31,465
♪Baby, you deserve it♪

143
00:08:33,217 --> 00:08:37,563
♪You're the perfect one I seek♪

144
00:08:37,664 --> 00:08:41,079
♪All my world's meant for you to keep♪

145
00:08:41,271 --> 00:08:45,325
♪Keep every piece,
every breath for you deep♪

146
00:08:58,440 --> 00:08:59,720
Your first time? You should've told me.

147
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:02,759
What's the point?

148
00:09:03,600 --> 00:09:05,120
If you'd told me,
I wouldn't have been so rough.

149
00:09:06,480 --> 00:09:07,679
Would that change anything?

150
00:09:12,080 --> 00:09:13,120
What's wrong with you?

151
00:09:13,480 --> 00:09:14,480
Split personality?

152
00:09:15,320 --> 00:09:16,279
Does it matter?

153
00:09:17,279 --> 00:09:18,399
Want to keep going?

154
00:09:18,399 --> 00:09:20,876
♪The moment we passed by♪

155
00:09:21,154 --> 00:09:24,273
♪My heartbeat lingered in my ear♪

156
00:09:24,749 --> 00:09:29,232
♪Your face froze before my eyes♪

157
00:09:30,300 --> 00:09:32,572
♪I'm always here♪

158
00:09:33,694 --> 00:09:37,441
♪Wherever you go♪

159
00:09:38,200 --> 00:09:39,866
♪Oh, you♪

160
00:09:40,508 --> 00:09:42,835
♪Wherever you are♪

161
00:09:43,240 --> 00:09:44,120
Can we turn on the light?

162
00:09:44,120 --> 00:09:45,159
♪Wherever you go♪

163
00:09:45,159 --> 00:09:46,120
I want to see you.

164
00:09:47,178 --> 00:09:51,120
♪Wherever you go♪

165
00:09:51,548 --> 00:09:53,560
♪For you♪

166
00:09:53,879 --> 00:09:55,279
If I hadn't stopped you earlier,

167
00:09:55,279 --> 00:09:56,759
what would you have said to that waiter?

168
00:09:57,399 --> 00:09:58,200
Asked for directions.

169
00:09:58,200 --> 00:09:59,720
♪Wherever you go♪

170
00:09:59,720 --> 00:10:00,639
Did I satisfy you?

171
00:10:03,320 --> 00:10:04,200
Not bad.

172
00:10:14,320 --> 00:10:15,399
Here's my number.

173
00:10:15,679 --> 00:10:17,000
Call me whenever you need me.

174
00:10:17,200 --> 00:10:18,039
Don't go to anyone else.

175
00:10:18,039 --> 00:10:22,456
♪Longing fills my empty hours♪

176
00:10:22,480 --> 00:10:23,679
You'll come whenever I call?

177
00:10:24,409 --> 00:10:27,003
♪You're used to bearing it alone,
never with a sigh♪

178
00:10:27,039 --> 00:10:28,159
I'll see it through with you.

179
00:10:30,226 --> 00:10:32,720
♪I'll be your harbor,
shield you from the rainy sky♪

180
00:10:32,720 --> 00:10:33,720
What's so funny?

181
00:10:33,720 --> 00:10:35,799
♪I'll be your harbor,
shield you from the rainy sky♪

182
00:10:35,799 --> 00:10:36,440
I like you.

183
00:10:37,127 --> 00:10:40,127
♪I'm always here♪

184
00:10:40,960 --> 00:10:42,240
You don't even know who I am.

185
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:43,200
And you like me?

186
00:10:45,360 --> 00:10:46,559
I like your kisses.

187
00:10:47,759 --> 00:10:48,919
Tell me your name.

188
00:10:50,759 --> 00:10:51,600
It doesn't matter.

189
00:10:51,600 --> 00:10:53,162
♪Wherever you go♪

190
00:10:54,004 --> 00:10:56,178
♪Wherever you go♪

191
00:10:56,200 --> 00:10:57,519
You're really heartless.

192
00:10:58,222 --> 00:11:00,129
♪For you♪

193
00:11:00,693 --> 00:11:03,880
♪Wherever you are♪

194
00:11:06,975 --> 00:11:09,335
♪Wherever you go♪

195
00:11:13,590 --> 00:11:15,996
♪Wherever you go♪

196
00:11:16,039 --> 00:11:17,039
Let's grab a bite together.

197
00:11:26,120 --> 00:11:27,240
She left right after sex?

198
00:11:28,279 --> 00:11:29,480
Cold-hearted, isn't she?

199
00:11:36,399 --> 00:11:37,080
Zhan Xiang.

200
00:11:37,559 --> 00:11:38,360
Find someone for me.

201
00:11:45,279 --> 00:11:46,039
Lu Mingyu.

202
00:11:46,159 --> 00:11:46,919
Stop right there!

203
00:11:50,519 --> 00:11:51,480
You wretch!

204
00:11:51,480 --> 00:11:52,600
You dare come home?

205
00:11:52,879 --> 00:11:53,679
Qian.

206
00:11:53,840 --> 00:11:55,679
What's wrong? You're hurting me.

207
00:11:55,759 --> 00:11:56,639
What's wrong?

208
00:11:56,879 --> 00:11:58,000
How dare you ask?

209
00:11:58,039 --> 00:11:59,279
What did you do to that painting?

210
00:11:59,360 --> 00:12:01,159
Qin Yuan was pissed off. You know?

211
00:12:01,480 --> 00:12:02,440
You wretch!

212
00:12:02,759 --> 00:12:04,080
You're just like your mother.

213
00:12:04,080 --> 00:12:05,320
You've completely ruined the alliance

214
00:12:05,320 --> 00:12:06,399
between the Lu and Qin families.

215
00:12:06,399 --> 00:12:07,279
Do you understand?

216
00:12:07,399 --> 00:12:08,399
What's wrong with the painting?

217
00:12:09,240 --> 00:12:10,200
I don't know.

218
00:12:10,200 --> 00:12:11,639
When I delivered the painting,

219
00:12:11,759 --> 00:12:13,440
it was perfectly fine.

220
00:12:14,840 --> 00:12:16,480
Stop pretending!

221
00:12:16,480 --> 00:12:17,759
You painted it

222
00:12:17,759 --> 00:12:19,039
and delivered it yourself.

223
00:12:19,039 --> 00:12:20,840
You were the last one to touch it.

224
00:12:20,840 --> 00:12:22,279
Who else could've done it?

225
00:12:22,320 --> 00:12:24,039
I put the painting on the stand.

226
00:12:24,360 --> 00:12:25,279
It fell over

227
00:12:25,279 --> 00:12:26,600
and hit my arm.

228
00:12:26,759 --> 00:12:28,799
So I went out to get an ice pack.

229
00:12:28,799 --> 00:12:30,279
When I came back,

230
00:12:30,360 --> 00:12:31,919
the stand was gone.

231
00:12:32,159 --> 00:12:34,360
I really don't know
what happened after that.

232
00:12:35,360 --> 00:12:35,960
Qian,

233
00:12:36,519 --> 00:12:37,919
see for yourself.

234
00:12:45,799 --> 00:12:48,279
No matter what, you're involved.

235
00:12:48,360 --> 00:12:49,480
You jinx.

236
00:12:50,159 --> 00:12:51,600
Well, there's no proof.

237
00:12:51,960 --> 00:12:53,759
Maybe Mingyu didn't do it.

238
00:12:54,240 --> 00:12:55,000
Hey.

239
00:12:55,440 --> 00:12:56,720
What's gotten into you?

240
00:12:57,000 --> 00:12:58,360
Why are you sticking up for her?

241
00:12:58,799 --> 00:12:59,519
Enough.

242
00:13:03,039 --> 00:13:04,399
Calm down, everyone.

243
00:13:11,720 --> 00:13:12,360
Mingyu,

244
00:13:13,080 --> 00:13:14,279
come to my study.

245
00:13:15,799 --> 00:13:16,440
Okay.

246
00:13:38,399 --> 00:13:39,519
Where's your hair clip?

247
00:13:39,919 --> 00:13:41,240
I lost it.

248
00:13:41,559 --> 00:13:43,440
The butler said
you went to the back courtyard again.

249
00:13:44,080 --> 00:13:44,799
Uncle.

250
00:13:45,879 --> 00:13:47,480
I'm part of the Lu family too.

251
00:13:47,840 --> 00:13:49,559
Can't I walk around my own home?

252
00:13:54,039 --> 00:13:55,440
Grandma's in poor health.

253
00:13:55,600 --> 00:13:57,279
Stop disturbing her all the time.

254
00:14:18,799 --> 00:14:19,559
Mingyu,

255
00:14:20,080 --> 00:14:21,279
learn to behave.

256
00:14:21,519 --> 00:14:22,759
The back courtyard's secluded.

257
00:14:23,559 --> 00:14:25,320
Your grandma's been alone too long.

258
00:14:25,720 --> 00:14:27,039
If she needs care

259
00:14:27,559 --> 00:14:29,120
or falls ill by accident,

260
00:14:29,679 --> 00:14:31,840
it won't be pleasant for her.

261
00:14:33,840 --> 00:14:36,200
How your grandma is treated
in this family

262
00:14:36,320 --> 00:14:38,080
depends on how you behave.

263
00:14:54,720 --> 00:14:55,720
With that hair clip on,

264
00:14:56,639 --> 00:14:58,399
you look just like your mother.

265
00:15:12,440 --> 00:15:14,200
Attending that distant relative's
birthday party

266
00:15:14,200 --> 00:15:14,960
wasn't a waste after all.

267
00:15:14,960 --> 00:15:15,919
We actually found

268
00:15:15,919 --> 00:15:17,600
an old photo of Auntie Chen.

269
00:15:19,200 --> 00:15:20,080
This photo

270
00:15:20,759 --> 00:15:22,639
looks a lot like the girl

271
00:15:23,320 --> 00:15:24,159
I met tonight.

272
00:15:25,480 --> 00:15:26,279
Xiuming,

273
00:15:26,919 --> 00:15:29,320
I think you miss that girl so much

274
00:15:29,320 --> 00:15:30,799
that everyone looks like her to you.

275
00:15:31,480 --> 00:15:32,799
What was Auntie Chen's kid called again?

276
00:15:33,399 --> 00:15:34,120
Ye.

277
00:15:34,759 --> 00:15:35,480
Ye...

278
00:15:36,639 --> 00:15:37,960
Sounds like a boy's name.

279
00:15:39,720 --> 00:15:41,000
Auntie Chen's getting on in years.

280
00:15:41,159 --> 00:15:43,120
Finding her would be difficult.

281
00:15:43,360 --> 00:15:44,840
But her child is another matter.

282
00:15:45,639 --> 00:15:47,480
Young people these days

283
00:15:47,840 --> 00:15:49,840
are all about socializing,
work and spending.

284
00:15:50,720 --> 00:15:52,120
They'll leave traces somewhere.

285
00:15:53,919 --> 00:15:54,960
Got it.

286
00:15:55,960 --> 00:15:57,519
So, shall we first look into

287
00:15:57,519 --> 00:15:59,879
the man you've never met

288
00:16:00,039 --> 00:16:01,080
or the lady

289
00:16:01,080 --> 00:16:03,440
you can't stop thinking about?

290
00:16:05,279 --> 00:16:06,200
Ladies first.

291
00:16:06,519 --> 00:16:08,200
Xiuming, you're impressive.

292
00:16:08,200 --> 00:16:09,399
I never knew "ladies first"

293
00:16:09,399 --> 00:16:10,519
could be used like that.

294
00:16:12,600 --> 00:16:13,600
You look better now,

295
00:16:14,080 --> 00:16:16,000
neat and proper.

296
00:16:16,240 --> 00:16:17,919
Keep wearing it.

297
00:16:18,320 --> 00:16:20,240
Your mother used to wear one too.

298
00:16:20,759 --> 00:16:22,159
I may look like my mother,

299
00:16:22,639 --> 00:16:25,080
but I have my father's blood in me too.

300
00:16:31,120 --> 00:16:32,480
If you agree

301
00:16:33,039 --> 00:16:34,440
to my terms,

302
00:16:35,000 --> 00:16:36,919
I'll let you visit your grandma.

303
00:16:43,159 --> 00:16:45,000
Drop dead.

304
00:16:51,039 --> 00:16:51,879
Repeat

305
00:16:52,559 --> 00:16:53,279
the family rules.

306
00:17:09,160 --> 00:17:12,039
(You must not defy your uncle's words.)

307
00:17:12,559 --> 00:17:15,480
(You can't neglect your uncle's orders.)

308
00:17:16,039 --> 00:17:17,799
(Always obey your elders' lead.)

309
00:17:17,960 --> 00:17:19,319
(Correct your faults with speed.)

310
00:17:19,599 --> 00:17:20,960
(Envy no one, never fight.)

311
00:17:21,039 --> 00:17:22,720
(Keep words and actions right.)

312
00:17:22,759 --> 00:17:24,400
(Report all you do and say.)

313
00:17:24,480 --> 00:17:26,000
(Hide nothing, come what may.)

314
00:17:26,400 --> 00:17:28,160
(Stay chaste and modest in heart.)

315
00:17:28,359 --> 00:17:29,839
(Men and women
must keep their distance.)

316
00:17:30,119 --> 00:17:31,720
(Never leave home at night.)

317
00:17:31,799 --> 00:17:33,519
(Never walk alone by day.)

318
00:17:33,759 --> 00:17:35,359
(Act with honor, stand upright.)

319
00:17:35,519 --> 00:17:37,119
(Do nothing improper.)

320
00:17:37,440 --> 00:17:38,920
(Let every word and deed)

321
00:17:39,160 --> 00:17:41,160
(be proper and clean indeed.)

322
00:17:44,799 --> 00:17:46,839
My life isn't mine to control.

323
00:17:48,240 --> 00:17:49,200
But my first time

324
00:17:50,079 --> 00:17:51,279
is mine to choose.

325
00:18:27,500 --> 00:18:32,115
♪Snapping the sweetest noon♪

326
00:18:34,665 --> 00:18:38,585
♪The sun and you are gentle♪

327
00:18:41,600 --> 00:18:46,293
♪Summer wakes up right now♪

328
00:18:47,410 --> 00:18:52,360
♪Chimes and cicadas have loved so long♪

329
00:18:54,750 --> 00:19:00,931
♪A love letter written in song♪

330
00:19:01,632 --> 00:19:06,440
♪A gentle kiss upon your brow♪

331
00:19:08,954 --> 00:19:14,875
♪Dragonflies glide as butterflies dance♪

332
00:19:15,652 --> 00:19:21,666
♪We mark this moment with a kite♪

333
00:19:21,928 --> 00:19:28,848
♪Gemini's joy lets art fill our love♪

334
00:19:29,808 --> 00:19:32,128
♪Close your eyes and count♪

335
00:19:32,274 --> 00:19:35,030
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪

336
00:19:35,030 --> 00:19:41,448
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪
